### Modulo iam — permissoes, papeis, atribuicoes e chaves de API.
@api = http://localhost:8000
@token = SUBSTITUA_PELO_ACCESS_TOKEN
@tenant = SUBSTITUA_PELO_ID_DO_TENANT

### Quem sou eu neste tenant e o que posso fazer
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/iam/whoami
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Catalogo de permissoes, agrupado por modulo
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/iam/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Papeis visiveis: os de sistema e os criados por este tenant
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/iam/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Criar um papel proprio
### Voce nao consegue conceder uma permissao que nao possui.
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/iam/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "vendedor",
  "name": "Vendedor",
  "description": "Opera apenas o funil de vendas",
  "permissions": ["crm.deal.read", "crm.deal.write", "crm.contact.read", "crm.activity.write"]
}

### Ver um papel
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/iam/roles/vendedor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Alterar nome e trocar o conjunto inteiro de permissoes
PATCH {{api}}/functions/v1/iam/roles/vendedor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Vendedor Senior", "permissions": ["crm.deal.read", "crm.deal.write"] }

### Conceder permissoes, preservando as demais
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/iam/roles/vendedor/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "permissions": ["crm.company.read"] }

### Revogar permissoes
DELETE {{api}}/functions/v1/iam/roles/vendedor/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "permissions": ["crm.company.read"] }

### Excluir um papel (recusado enquanto houver membro usando)
DELETE {{api}}/functions/v1/iam/roles/vendedor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Atribuir um papel a um membro
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/iam/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "UUID_DO_USUARIO", "role": "vendedor" }

### Emitir chave de API — o segredo aparece so nesta resposta
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/iam/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Integracao com o ERP", "scopes": ["crm.deal.read"], "expiresInDays": 365 }

### Listar chaves
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/iam/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Revogar uma chave
DELETE {{api}}/functions/v1/iam/api-keys/UUID_DA_CHAVE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
